data-dependent guard: one censused accumulator per localized peel site: true
every localized site of the plain nest peels the reduction level alone, unguarded: true
every localized site of the shared-cell nest peels BOTH levels through a confined guard: true
every localized site of the per-row nest peels the reduction level alone through a lane-private guard: true
both guarded nests localize, and their peel verdicts differ: true
