the same guard over a shared cell refuses, and the report leaves that guard unresolved: true
no refusing report claims an admitted lane-private guard: true
an inner bracket summarizes only its own sites: true
the enclosing bracket sees both, in emission order: true
a completed bracket leaves the census global as it found it: true
collection is off outside every bracket: true
a gather from a different fixed first slot is not a cell recurrence: true
a gather from a different fixed last slot is not a cell recurrence: true
matching static slots keep a potentially aliasing gather in the census: true
a one-axis gather cannot prove disjointness from its placeholder: true
a symbolic static slot may alias a fixed written slot: true
different symbolic static slots may alias each other: true
